<title>USA: Scitex CFO Giora Bitan to resign.</title>
<headline>Scitex CFO Giora Bitan to resign.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scitex Corp said Wednesday Giora Bitan, its executive vice president and chief financial officer, had told the company that he was planning on resigning.  </p>
<p>Scitex, which makes digital cameras and other equipment, said Bitan would remain in the post until the company had found a replacement &quot;to ensure a smooth transition&quot;.</p>
<p>It said Bitan had been in the company for 14 years, the last nine as chief financial officer.</p>
</text>
